Article 9
Child victims of violence, in addition to obtaining the rights as referred to in Article 8, also obtain the following special rights:
a. the right to respect and full fulfillment for survival, growth, and development;
b. the right to basic services;
c. the right to equal protection;
d. the right to be free from various stigmas; and
e. the right to obtain freedom.

